<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel is conducting air and drone strikes in southern Lebanon that have killed a Hezbollah operative, wounded another, and killed a civilian on a motorcycle while wounding a second. Hezbollah is responding with artillery fire on Israeli positions and has begun distributing its first cash payments to war victims and displaced families. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon due to the fighting. The conflict continues as both sides exchange fire, extending the displacement and humanitarian impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168713&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFB1VkUyUE9uVUE3REF1UmhLa1U1c3BraFlLR0IyNWRGQVZlUlpPOFlaRk5RVk5tMDdDZDl5U05OV2xoU0FpeDgzbVNvMmU5c05jV2dFdUZVYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQUEhxNnNSVnAzcGlvUlBDOFRERjlYZW1WVTJHV3Z3NFdmWFBuX2ZDMUx6MHlkN3RjQmMwYloxSlN3bXFPeTlXYkJoXzZKX2dGM3BlcHdlLWVFdFk2T2RxZFV0azV3T0dKVldTWUNTR1N0dFFwZkVxUFRkSkJzcHFqdXNMR3p6VmVpcy01MFhkNHE5UjIyYkFfT2tKSGtiYnNkQ205cW5NVjJncVZQanc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPUHBWcEdPQXpBSzB2REVhcUNjWkc2VzBELW1iRE9nQWhKV3MyQlkxQUFYVUUwYnVrci1nbEY5Nkw5UXdXQ0JXSGdCd3RJaHlVd3pjVkl0RzZUek04WElUcmNZWnFVQXJ1UVpOSVFFU3dpZDJHR19mdFZTSmo2TDM4c0x3SXZtYmU4TmM5cWZYcGxjdlVMbmszN2NWek5Nb1c5X0hhNWw4TEMyOHZET3VfUmU0WDZtRk5ER1lOdTZiVTNnRUhnd0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxOcy1pbzdQMzZQbktDOGVLWHJvdVRrb0pCUlpuT1MyMkM5b1BjTlcwZDlJUXl0LWdOTU1UczlwcXJSNl9YSXVyeHVHaUNRRWpuMzlFWVBlVzR6WWRSTk9qalk5X09oOTRheEQ3ZlJrS0dkSENjNG9